                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Table of the three listings ranked highest on TMDB popularity, each shown beside its evidence-weighted rating rank and its revenue rank. The finding: the popularity ranking tracks neither of the other two. TMDB does not publish the popularity formula, so popularity is ranked under protest and never called quality.'"
